proof = "Committed testdata/repair38-rpc.json retains reviewed code-read bytes and ABI boundary vectors, checks every role and implementation hash against unchanged deployment.Approved manifests, and serves only canonical hash-pinned reads over a test-owned loopback RPC. Production PinnedRPCReader, deployment.Attest, PreflightEngine, HTTP handler and ConnectedCapabilitiesPreflight decoder run in process. Native creation cost tests exercise both transaction destinations, destination-only allowance rejection, disclosed 0x1017 approval and gas admission, and the recorded consumed allowance; pool tests exercise registry binding, state, quotes, generation, both quote/trading consumers, negative identities and historical beacons. These SDK fixture tests do not claim to execute paxd creation or swaps."
