wiring_paxd = "daemon/paxd and modules/launchpad/keeper (chain runtime domain): execute live creation through both admitted entries using creationCost.spender and native pool quote/trade integration in the chain domain gate; this SDK gate replays committed peers only."
wiring_runtime = "sdk/launchpad/shared/config/deployment/current.json and attest_surface_test.go (deployment identity domain): reconcile the approved 41-byte surface runtime with the 51-byte runtime installed by modules/launchpad/keeper/market.go (chain runtime domain), preserving exact code-hash attestation."

